			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): Complete PascalCase naming migration for RPC modules\n\nRename all remaining snake_case module files to PascalCase throughout the RPC layer:\n- commands.rs → Commands.rs\n- configuration.rs → Configuration.rs\n- debug.rs → Debug.rs\n- processes.rs → Processes.rs\n- scm.rs → SCM.rs\n- telemetry.rs → Telemetry.rs\n- terminals.rs → Terminals.rs\n- types.rs → Types.rs\n- vine.rs → Vine.rs\n- windows.rs → Windows.rs\n- workspace.rs → Workspace.rs\n\nAlso remove deprecated/unused service modules that have been refactored elsewhere:\n- CommandService.rs, Command/Validation/mod.rs\n- SecretStorageService.rs, SecretStorageState.rs\n- WindowService.rs, WindowState.rs\n- WorkspaceService.rs\n- Telemetry/Metrics/mod.rs, Telemetry/Spans/mod.rs\n\nUpdate mod.rs to use explicit #[path] attributes for all modules, replacing implicit snake_case resolution. This completes the PascalCase migration for the RPC subsystem, following the pattern established in previous commits for Environment, LanguageFeature, and other modules.",
