			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): Complete PascalCase naming migration for Environment and LanguageFeature modules\n\nRename remaining snake_case module files to PascalCase throughout the Mountain codebase:\n\n- LanguageFeature: validation.rs → Validation.rs, hover.rs → Hover.rs, highlights.rs → Highlights.rs, completions.rs → Completions.rs, definition.rs → Definition.rs, references.rs → References.rs\n- StatusBarProvider: tooltip.rs → Tooltip.rs\n- WebviewProvider: lifecycle.rs → Lifecycle.rs, configuration.rs → Configuration.rs, messaging.rs → Messaging.rs\n\nUpdate all module references and function calls in parent modules to use the new PascalCase names. Also standardize function names to PascalCase (provide_Tooltip_impl).\n\nThis completes the PascalCase migration started in the previous commit, ensuring consistent naming conventions across the entire Mountain codebase.",
